Publish F40 archives in verified parallel storage parts

Transfer at most four 16 MiB parts concurrently while retaining per-part and complete-archive byte verification. Read both segmented and existing single-file archives without changing fact bytes. Reject missing, reordered, escaped, or corrupted parts before completion. Validation: 83 targeted tests passed.


